{TEXT("The crew lowers the muzzle and fires along the ordered sector.\nDirect fire answers quickly, striking infantry and damaging hulls and tracks. Banks and fortifications intercept the shells.\nDirect-fire rounds up to 6"), TEXT("The crew lowers the muzzle and fires along the ordered sector."), TEXT("Direct fire answers quickly, striking infantry and damaging hulls and tracks. Banks and fortifications intercept the shells."), TEXT("Direct-fire rounds up to 6")},
{TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。"), TEXT("扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。"), TEXT("低空扫射 2 次")},
{TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead."), TEXT("Strafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk."), TEXT("Low passes 2")},
{TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。"), TEXT("弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。"), TEXT("弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发")},
{TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust."), TEXT("Repeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts."), TEXT("Barrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3")},
{TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。"), TEXT("空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。"), TEXT("榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发")},
{TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet."), TEXT("Airburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths."), TEXT("Shrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3")},
{TEXT("炸弹挂架依次打开，航线下的道路没入烟尘。\n一列炸弹沿选定航线间隔落下，覆盖步兵和装甲；须避开友军。"), TEXT("炸弹挂架依次打开，航线下的道路没入烟尘。"), TEXT("一列炸弹沿选定航线间隔落下，覆盖步兵和装甲；须避开友军。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The racks open in succession; the road below disappears into dust.\nSpaced bombs follow the selected flight path, striking infantry and armour. Keep friendly troops clear."), TEXT("The racks open in succession; the road below disappears into dust."), TEXT("Spaced bombs follow the selected flight path, striking infantry and armour. Keep friendly troops clear."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("射手测距、屏息，预压扳机。\n靶场训练让步枪射击更准确。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("射手测距、屏息，预压扳机。"), TEXT("靶场训练让步枪射击更准确。"), TEXT("步枪命中率 +10%")},
{TEXT("The rifleman judges the range, holds his breath and takes the first pressure.\nRange practice steadies rifle fire.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("The rifleman judges the range, holds his breath and takes the first pressure."), TEXT("Range practice steadies rifle fire."), TEXT("Rifle accuracy +10%")},
{TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。\n缩短换弹时的停火空隙。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。"), TEXT("缩短换弹时的停火空隙。"), TEXT("武器装填时间 −15%")},
{TEXT("A charger seats in the magazine; a belt feeds through the gun.\nReload drill shortens pauses in fire.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("A charger seats in the magazine; a belt feeds through the gun."), TEXT("Reload drill shortens pauses in fire."), TEXT("Weapon reload time −15%")},
{TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。\n枪组以更稳的点射压住目标。\n机枪压制 +18%"), TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。"), TEXT("枪组以更稳的点射压住目标。"), TEXT("机枪压制 +18%")},
{TEXT("The gunner braces the stock, his bearer beside him.\nSteady bursts keep the target under stronger suppression.\nMachine-gun suppression +18%"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock, his bearer beside him."), TEXT("Steady bursts keep the target under stronger suppression."), TEXT("Machine-gun suppression +18%")},
{TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。\n备齐弹药，让野炮更快再次接令。\n野炮整备 −15%"), TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。"), TEXT("备齐弹药，让野炮更快再次接令。"), TEXT("野炮整备 −15%")},
{TEXT("Fuzes wait at the battery as ammunition comes up the communication trench.\nPrepared supplies bring the guns back into action sooner.\nArtillery readiness −15%"), TEXT("Fuzes wait at the battery as ammunition comes up the communication trench."), TEXT("Prepared supplies bring the guns back into action sooner."), TEXT("Artillery readiness −15%")},
{TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。\n投弹手更准确地把手雷送入敌阵。\n手雷命中率 +12%"), TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。"), TEXT("投弹手更准确地把手雷送入敌阵。"), TEXT("手雷命中率 +12%")},
{TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet.\nBombing drill places grenades more accurately.\nGrenade accuracy +12%"), TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet."), TEXT("Bombing drill places grenades more accurately."), TEXT("Grenade accuracy +12%")},
{TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。\n补给队提前备齐下一支小队的装备。\n步兵整备 −10%"), TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。"), TEXT("补给队提前备齐下一支小队的装备。"), TEXT("步兵整备 −10%")},
{TEXT("Drafts report through the trench as wagons unload behind the line.\nThe depot prepares the next section’s equipment sooner.\nInfantry readiness −10%"), TEXT("Drafts report through the trench as wagons unload behind the line."), TEXT("The depot prepares the next section’s equipment sooner."), TEXT("Infantry readiness −10%")},
{TEXT("机枪守住胸墙，步枪班从侧旁出壕。\n驻壕枪组开火时，掩护附近推进的步兵。\n推进步兵所受枪弹压制 −35%"), TEXT("机枪守住胸墙，步枪班从侧旁出壕。"), TEXT("驻壕枪组开火时，掩护附近推进的步兵。"), TEXT("推进步兵所受枪弹压制 −35%")},
{TEXT("The gun holds the parapet while riflemen leave by its flank.\nFiring trench guns cover nearby advancing infantry.\nAdvancing infantry’s bullet suppression taken −35%"), TEXT("The gun holds the parapet while riflemen leave by its flank."), TEXT("Firing trench guns cover nearby advancing infantry."), TEXT("Advancing infantry’s bullet suppression taken −35%")},
{TEXT("委任状交到军士手中，肩章随队前送。\n晋升的军官行进中重整部队，驻壕步枪也更善压住移动目标。\n指挥命中率加成 +50%"), TEXT("委任状交到军士手中，肩章随队前送。"), TEXT("晋升的军官行进中重整部队，驻壕步枪也更善压住移动目标。"), TEXT("指挥命中率加成 +50%")},
{TEXT("The NCO receives his commission and officer’s shoulder straps.\nThe promoted officer rallies on the move; trench rifles suppress moving targets more strongly.\nCommand accuracy bonus +50%"), TEXT("The NCO receives his commission and officer’s shoulder straps."), TEXT("The promoted officer rallies on the move; trench rifles suppress moving targets more strongly."), TEXT("Command accuracy bonus +50%")},
{TEXT("枪口横移，点射扫过相邻射孔。\n机枪的压制火力覆盖目标周围更大的地域。"), TEXT("枪口横移，点射扫过相邻射孔。"), TEXT("机枪的压制火力覆盖目标周围更大的地域。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The muzzle traverses, carrying bursts past adjoining loopholes.\nMachine guns suppress a wider area around the target."), TEXT("The muzzle traverses, carrying bursts past adjoining loopholes."), TEXT("Machine guns suppress a wider area around the target."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("枪口退入胸墙暗影，只留一道射孔。\n驻壕机枪手更难被枪弹压住或击中。\n驻壕枪手中弹概率 −25%\n所受枪弹压制 −25%"), TEXT("枪口退入胸墙暗影，只留一道射孔。"), TEXT("驻壕机枪手更难被枪弹压住或击中。"), TEXT("驻壕枪手中弹概率 −25%\n所受枪弹压制 −25%")},
{TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet’s shadow, leaving a narrow loophole.\nEntrenched gunners are harder to hit or suppress with bullets.\nEntrenched gunner hit chance −25%\nBullet suppression taken −25%"), TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet’s shadow, leaving a narrow loophole."), TEXT("Entrenched gunners are harder to hit or suppress with bullets."), TEXT("Entrenched gunner hit chance −25%\nBullet suppression taken −25%")},
{TEXT("射手倒下，同伴接住枪托。\n同伴抵达枪位后接替射手，继续使用枪内剩余弹药。"), TEXT("射手倒下，同伴接住枪托。"), TEXT("同伴抵达枪位后接替射手，继续使用枪内剩余弹药。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The gunner falls; his number two takes the stock.\nCrewmen reaching the gun take over and continue with its remaining ammunition."), TEXT("The gunner falls; his number two takes the stock."), TEXT("Crewmen reaching the gun take over and continue with its remaining ammunition."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("步枪班从枪位侧旁出壕，机枪手守住射界。\n整壕前进时，机枪组留守掩护附近的冲锋步兵。壕内仅余枪组时，再次下令即可前进。\n掩护冲锋时命中率 +25%\n点射恢复时间 −35%"), TEXT("步枪班从枪位侧旁出壕，机枪手守住射界。"), TEXT("整壕前进时，机枪组留守掩护附近的冲锋步兵。壕内仅余枪组时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("掩护冲锋时命中率 +25%\n点射恢复时间 −35%")},
{TEXT("The rifles leave by the gun post; the gunner covers the approach.\nA trench advance leaves gun sections to cover nearby assault infantry. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward.\nCovering-assault accuracy +25%\nBurst recovery −35%"), TEXT("The rifles leave by the gun post; the gunner covers the approach."), TEXT("A trench advance leaves gun sections to cover nearby assault infantry. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("Covering-assault accuracy +25%\nBurst recovery −35%")},
{TEXT("委任状送抵指挥所，军士换上肩章。\n晋升的军官在更大范围内重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("委任状送抵指挥所，军士换上肩章。"), TEXT("晋升的军官在更大范围内重整部队。"), TEXT("指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒")},
{TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO changes his shoulder straps.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops across a wider area.\nCommand accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO changes his shoulder straps."), TEXT("The promoted officer rallies troops across a wider area."), TEXT("Command accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds")},
{TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n部队借己方烟幕接近敌阵，减少途中受到的枪弹压制，抵近后开火。\n烟幕内推进所受枪弹压制 −50%"), TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。"), TEXT("部队借己方烟幕接近敌阵，减少途中受到的枪弹压制，抵近后开火。"), TEXT("烟幕内推进所受枪弹压制 −50%")},
{TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nFriendly smoke shields the approach from bullet suppression; the men close before opening fire.\nBullet suppression while advancing in smoke −50%"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn."), TEXT("Friendly smoke shields the approach from bullet suppression; the men close before opening fire."), TEXT("Bullet suppression while advancing in smoke −50%")},
{TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。"), TEXT("指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery."), TEXT("Halted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。"), TEXT("迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot."), TEXT("Mortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。"), TEXT("投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。"), TEXT("佩戴后毒气累积 −78%")},
{TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal."), TEXT("Bombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal."), TEXT("Gas build-up after masking −78%")},
{TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。\n追加喷射 4 次"), TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。"), TEXT("喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。"), TEXT("追加喷射 4 次")},
{TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted.\nAdditional bursts 4"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench."), TEXT("Flame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted."), TEXT("Additional bursts 4")},
{TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。\n己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹和航空轰炸更快再次接令。\n紧急火力整备 −22%"), TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。"), TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹和航空轰炸更快再次接令。"), TEXT("紧急火力整备 −22%")},
{TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened.\nBelow 35 friendly morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel and aerial bombing answer again sooner.\nEmergency-fire readiness −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened."), TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel and aerial bombing answer again sooner."), TEXT("Emergency-fire readiness −22%")},
{TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。"), TEXT("同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。"), TEXT("专门射手装填时间 −15%")},
{TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock."), TEXT("A section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby."), TEXT("Specialist reload time −15%")},
{TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。"), TEXT("解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。"), TEXT("架设与收枪速度 +30%")},
{TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march."), TEXT("Mobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation."), TEXT("Deployment and packing speed +30%")},
{TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。\n加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。\n履带耐久 +18%"), TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。"), TEXT("加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。"), TEXT("履带耐久 +18%")},
{TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks.\nReinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability.\nTrack durability +18%"), TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks."), TEXT("Reinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability."), TEXT("Track durability +18%")},
{TEXT("回收队在修理棚里试装履带节与销轴。\n加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。\n履带耐久 +25%"), TEXT("回收队在修理棚里试装履带节与销轴。"), TEXT("加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。"), TEXT("履带耐久 +25%")},
{TEXT("The recovery crew tests links and pins in the workshop.\nReinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability.\nTrack durability +25%"), TEXT("The recovery crew tests links and pins in the workshop."), TEXT("Reinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability."), TEXT("Track durability +25%")},
{TEXT("枪座补上铆接护件，车组校正机枪轴线。\n护件提高枪位承受损伤的能力。\n车载机枪耐久 +35%"), TEXT("枪座补上铆接护件，车组校正机枪轴线。"), TEXT("护件提高枪位承受损伤的能力。"), TEXT("车载机枪耐久 +35%")},
{TEXT("Riveted reinforcement braces the mounting; the crew checks the gun’s alignment.\nThe guards keep the gun mounting in action under damage.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +35%"), TEXT("Riveted reinforcement braces the mounting; the crew checks the gun’s alignment."), TEXT("The guards keep the gun mounting in action under damage."), TEXT("Vehicle machine-gun durability +35%")},
{TEXT("护板铆在射孔旁，枪手试转枪座。\n护板提高枪位承受损伤的能力。\n车载机枪耐久 +20%"), TEXT("护板铆在射孔旁，枪手试转枪座。"), TEXT("护板提高枪位承受损伤的能力。"), TEXT("车载机枪耐久 +20%")},
{TEXT("A guard is riveted beside the port as the gunner tests the mounting.\nProtected mountings withstand more damage.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +20%"), TEXT("A guard is riveted beside the port as the gunner tests the mounting."), TEXT("Protected mountings withstand more damage."), TEXT("Vehicle machine-gun durability +20%")},
{TEXT("炮手报出目标，装填手合上炮闩。\n炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。\n坦克炮装填时间 −8%"), TEXT("炮手报出目标，装填手合上炮闩。"), TEXT("炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。"), TEXT("坦克炮装填时间 −8%")},
{TEXT("The gunner calls the target; the loader closes the breech.\nThe crew shortens the loading pause between shots.\nTank cannon reload time −8%"), TEXT("The gunner calls the target; the loader closes the breech."), TEXT("The crew shortens the loading pause between shots."), TEXT("Tank cannon reload time −8%")},
{TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。"), TEXT("炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。"), TEXT("坦克炮装填时间 −12%")},
{TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner’s word.\nThe crew shortens the loading pause between shots.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner’s word."), TEXT("The crew shortens the loading pause between shots."), TEXT("Tank cannon reload time −12%")},
{TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\nMark IV 雄型以火炮和机枪支援突破、迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需步兵清壕；野炮威胁车体，履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。"), TEXT("Mark IV 雄型以火炮和机枪支援突破、迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需步兵清壕；野炮威胁车体，履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nThe Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns. Slow to advance, it needs infantry to clear trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip."), TEXT("The Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns. Slow to advance, it needs infantry to clear trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪转向逃离的步兵。\nWhippet 快速追击暴露步兵，遇到敌方装甲需要炮兵支援。"), TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪转向逃离的步兵。"), TEXT("Whippet 快速追击暴露步兵，遇到敌方装甲需要炮兵支援。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Tracks skirt a shell hole as the guns turn towards withdrawing infantry.\nThe Whippet pursues exposed infantry rapidly. Enemy armour requires supporting guns."), TEXT("Tracks skirt a shell hole as the guns turn towards withdrawing infantry."), TEXT("The Whippet pursues exposed infantry rapidly. Enemy armour requires supporting guns."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。\nA7V 以主炮迎击装甲、机枪压住步兵。车体笨重，侧翼需步兵掩护；野炮威胁车体，履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。"), TEXT("A7V 以主炮迎击装甲、机枪压住步兵。车体笨重，侧翼需步兵掩护；野炮威胁车体，履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction as side guns cover the approaches.\nThe A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with machine guns. The cumbersome hull needs flank cover; field guns threaten it, and tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction as side guns cover the approaches."), TEXT("The A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with machine guns. The cumbersome hull needs flank cover; field guns threaten it, and tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好十字，炮口掉转方向。\n缴获 Mark IV 以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，野炮与反坦克步枪威胁车体；履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好十字，炮口掉转方向。"), TEXT("缴获 Mark IV 以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，野炮与反坦克步枪威胁车体；履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The repair crew paints crosses on the captured hull and turns its guns about.\nA captured Mark IV supports infantry with cannon and machine guns. Slow to move and vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles; tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("The repair crew paints crosses on the captured hull and turns its guns about."), TEXT("A captured Mark IV supports infantry with cannon and machine guns. Slow to move and vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles; tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。\nMark IV 雌型以五挺 刘易斯 压住步兵，整备快于雄型、移动远慢于 Whippet。机枪不能毁伤坦克车体；履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。"), TEXT("Mark IV 雌型以五挺 刘易斯 压住步兵，整备快于雄型、移动远慢于 Whippet。机枪不能毁伤坦克车体；履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons, ammunition boxes against the inner plates.\nFive Lewis guns suppress infantry. The Female readies sooner than the Male but moves far slower than a Whippet. Its guns cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons, ammunition boxes against the inner plates."), TEXT("Five Lewis guns suppress infantry. The Female readies sooner than the Male but moves far slower than a Whippet. Its guns cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("缴获车体重新开动，机枪扫向原来的阵线。\n缴获 Mark IV 雌型以五挺机枪压住步兵，整备快于火炮型。对付坦克仍需反装甲支援。"), TEXT("缴获车体重新开动，机枪扫向原来的阵线。"), TEXT("缴获 Mark IV 雌型以五挺机枪压住步兵，整备快于火炮型。对付坦克仍需反装甲支援。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its guns facing the line it once defended.\nFive machine guns suppress infantry, with shorter readiness than cannon variants. Tanks still require anti-armour support."), TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its guns facing the line it once defended."), TEXT("Five machine guns suppress infantry, with shorter readiness than cannon variants. Tanks still require anti-armour support."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("靶场上，射手核对距离，重新抵紧枪托。\n测距训练让步枪射击更准确。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("靶场上，射手核对距离，重新抵紧枪托。"), TEXT("测距训练让步枪射击更准确。"), TEXT("步枪命中率 +10%")},
{TEXT("On the range, the rifleman judges the distance and braces his stock.\nRange estimation steadies rifle fire.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("On the range, the rifleman judges the distance and braces his stock."), TEXT("Range estimation steadies rifle fire."), TEXT("Rifle accuracy +10%")},
{TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。\n装填手缩短换弹时的停火空隙。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。"), TEXT("装填手缩短换弹时的停火空隙。"), TEXT("武器装填时间 −15%")},
{TEXT("A charger fills the magazine; a fresh pan seats on the gun.\nReload drill shortens pauses in fire.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("A charger fills the magazine; a fresh pan seats on the gun."), TEXT("Reload drill shortens pauses in fire."), TEXT("Weapon reload time −15%")},
{TEXT("军士领到委任状，口令传进交通壕。\n晋升的军官行进中重整部队，驻壕步枪更善压住移动目标。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%"), TEXT("军士领到委任状，口令传进交通壕。"), TEXT("晋升的军官行进中重整部队，驻壕步枪更善压住移动目标。"), TEXT("指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%")},
{TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order down the trench.\nThe promoted officer rallies on the move; trench rifles suppress moving targets more strongly.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds\nTrench-rifle suppression of moving targets +40%"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order down the trench."), TEXT("The promoted officer rallies on the move; trench rifles suppress moving targets more strongly."), TEXT("Command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds\nTrench-rifle suppression of moving targets +40%")},
{TEXT("委任状送到指挥所，军士摘下臂章。\n晋升的军官更频繁地重整部队，指挥范围扩大。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒"), TEXT("委任状送到指挥所，军士摘下臂章。"), TEXT("晋升的军官更频繁地重整部队，指挥范围扩大。"), TEXT("指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒")},
{TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge.\nThe promoted officer rallies more often across a wider area.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge."), TEXT("The promoted officer rallies more often across a wider area."), TEXT("Command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds")},
{TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮时，炮组追加补射。\n追加齐射 1 轮"), TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。"), TEXT("向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮时，炮组追加补射。"), TEXT("追加齐射 1 轮")},
{TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches beyond the smoke.\nGuns called into friendly smoke fire an additional salvo.\nAdditional salvo 1"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches beyond the smoke."), TEXT("Guns called into friendly smoke fire an additional salvo."), TEXT("Additional salvo 1")},
{TEXT("守军伏低，投弹手把手雷送过胸墙。\n投弹手更易命中被重度压制的驻壕守军。\n重压制驻壕目标手雷命中率 +35%"), TEXT("守军伏低，投弹手把手雷送过胸墙。"), TEXT("投弹手更易命中被重度压制的驻壕守军。"), TEXT("重压制驻壕目标手雷命中率 +35%")},
{TEXT("The defenders duck as a bomber sends a grenade over the parapet.\nBombers hit heavily suppressed trench defenders more reliably.\nGrenade accuracy against pinned trench troops +35%"), TEXT("The defenders duck as a bomber sends a grenade over the parapet."), TEXT("Bombers hit heavily suppressed trench defenders more reliably."), TEXT("Grenade accuracy against pinned trench troops +35%")},
{TEXT("镜瞄步枪送到前沿，射手重新校正瞄具。\n精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE，获得更远、更准确的射击。"), TEXT("镜瞄步枪送到前沿，射手重新校正瞄具。"), TEXT("精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE，获得更远、更准确的射击。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Scoped rifles reach the front; the marksman checks his sights again.\nMarksmen receive scoped SMLEs for greater range and accuracy."), TEXT("Scoped rifles reach the front; the marksman checks his sights again."), TEXT("Marksmen receive scoped SMLEs for greater range and accuracy."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("弹鼓装进 MP 18，突击手在出壕口验枪。\n突击班换装近距离自动火力，适用于 1918 年的行动。"), TEXT("弹鼓装进 MP 18，突击手在出壕口验枪。"), TEXT("突击班换装近距离自动火力，适用于 1918 年的行动。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("A drum seats in the MP 18 as the assault party checks its weapons.\nBombing sections receive close-range automatic fire for operations in 1918."), TEXT("A drum seats in the MP 18 as the assault party checks its weapons."), TEXT("Bombing sections receive close-range automatic fire for operations in 1918."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。"), TEXT("狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench."), TEXT("Snipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("相邻枪位转动枪口，射界交于通路中央。\n分散驻壕的机枪同时开火，形成交叉压制。\n交叉火力压制 +40%"), TEXT("相邻枪位转动枪口，射界交于通路中央。"), TEXT("分散驻壕的机枪同时开火，形成交叉压制。"), TEXT("交叉火力压制 +40%")},
{TEXT("Neighbouring posts turn their muzzles until their arcs meet.\nSeparated trench guns firing together establish crossfire.\nCrossfire suppression +40%"), TEXT("Neighbouring posts turn their muzzles until their arcs meet."), TEXT("Separated trench guns firing together establish crossfire."), TEXT("Crossfire suppression +40%")},
{TEXT("口令越过胸墙，前队循声重新展开。\n附近指挥组刚重整过的推进步兵，更能承受枪弹压制。\n短时间所受枪弹压制 −30%"), TEXT("口令越过胸墙，前队循声重新展开。"), TEXT("附近指挥组刚重整过的推进步兵，更能承受枪弹压制。"), TEXT("短时间所受枪弹压制 −30%")},
{TEXT("An order carries over the parapet; the leading men spread out again.\nAdvancing infantry just rallied by a nearby commander withstand bullet suppression better.\nBrief bullet-suppression reduction −30%"), TEXT("An order carries over the parapet; the leading men spread out again."), TEXT("Advancing infantry just rallied by a nearby commander withstand bullet suppression better."), TEXT("Brief bullet-suppression reduction −30%")},
{TEXT("短点射越过壕角，邻近的守军伏低身子。\n十米内射击驻壕目标时，邻近压制范围扩大至4.5米。"), TEXT("短点射越过壕角，邻近的守军伏低身子。"), TEXT("十米内射击驻壕目标时，邻近压制范围扩大至4.5米。"), TEXT("邻近压制半径：4.5米；须在十米内射击驻壕目标。")},
{TEXT("Short bursts pass the traverse; nearby defenders duck below the lip.\nWithin 10 metres, firing on troops in a trench expands adjacent suppression to 4.5 metres."), TEXT("Short bursts pass the traverse; nearby defenders duck below the lip."), TEXT("Within 10 metres, firing on troops in a trench expands adjacent suppression to 4.5 metres."), TEXT("Adjacent suppression radius: 4.5 metres; target must be in a trench within 10 metres.")},
{TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。\n守军一时没有目标、压力减轻时，自行把不足半数的弹仓压满。"), TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。"), TEXT("守军一时没有目标、压力减轻时，自行把不足半数的弹仓压满。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench.\nWith no target showing and suppression eased, defenders top up magazines holding less than half their ammunition."), TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench."), TEXT("With no target showing and suppression eased, defenders top up magazines holding less than half their ammunition."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("空弹鼓放到壕底，射手取出装满的一只。\n驻壕突击队一时没有目标、压力减轻时，自行换掉不足半数的弹鼓。"), TEXT("空弹鼓放到壕底，射手取出装满的一只。"), TEXT("驻壕突击队一时没有目标、压力减轻时，自行换掉不足半数的弹鼓。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("A spent drum lies on the trench floor; the gunner takes a full one.\nWith no target showing and suppression eased, entrenched storm troops replace drums holding less than half their ammunition."), TEXT("A spent drum lies on the trench floor; the gunner takes a full one."), TEXT("With no target showing and suppression eased, entrenched storm troops replace drums holding less than half their ammunition."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。"), TEXT("投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。"), TEXT("佩戴后毒气累积 −78%")},
{TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings."), TEXT("Bombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped."), TEXT("Gas build-up after masking −78%")},
{TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵更快排除地雷与爆炸物。\n排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。"), TEXT("工兵更快排除地雷与爆炸物。"), TEXT("排爆速度 +65%")},
{TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneers clear mines and explosive hazards more quickly.\nExplosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him."), TEXT("Pioneers clear mines and explosive hazards more quickly."), TEXT("Explosive clearance speed +65%")},
{TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。\n追加喷射 4 次"), TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。"), TEXT("喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。"), TEXT("追加喷射 4 次")},
{TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted.\nAdditional bursts 4"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose."), TEXT("Flame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted."), TEXT("Additional bursts 4")},
{TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。\n徐进弹幕缩短推进间距，更密集地覆盖阵地。"), TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。"), TEXT("徐进弹幕缩短推进间距，更密集地覆盖阵地。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan.\nCreeping barrages advance in shorter lifts for denser coverage."), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan."), TEXT("Creeping barrages advance in shorter lifts for denser coverage."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮闩旁。\n榴霰弹炮组增加一轮齐射。\n齐射轮数 2 → 3\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮闩旁。"), TEXT("榴霰弹炮组增加一轮齐射。"), TEXT("齐射轮数 2 → 3\n每轮炮弹 3 发")},
{TEXT("Fuzes are set; reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nThe shrapnel battery adds another salvo.\nSalvos 2 → 3\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; reserve shells wait beside the breech."), TEXT("The shrapnel battery adds another salvo."), TEXT("Salvos 2 → 3\nShells per salvo 3")},
{TEXT("反坦克炮移到路堤旁，弹药车跟随就位。\n铁路行动的野炮更快准备下一次直射。\n铁路行动反坦克炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("反坦克炮移到路堤旁，弹药车跟随就位。"), TEXT("铁路行动的野炮更快准备下一次直射。"), TEXT("铁路行动反坦克炮整备 −18%")},
{TEXT("Anti-tank guns take position beside the embankment; ammunition wagons follow.\nRailway operations bring the field guns back to direct fire sooner.\nRailway anti-tank-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("Anti-tank guns take position beside the embankment; ammunition wagons follow."), TEXT("Railway operations bring the field guns back to direct fire sooner."), TEXT("Railway anti-tank-gun readiness −18%")},
{TEXT("车体铆上补强板，炮组核对铁路接近线。\n装甲列车更耐打击，铁路行动中的反坦克炮更快再次接令。\n装甲列车车体耐久 +22%\n铁路行动反坦克炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("车体铆上补强板，炮组核对铁路接近线。"), TEXT("装甲列车更耐打击，铁路行动中的反坦克炮更快再次接令。"), TEXT("装甲列车车体耐久 +22%\n铁路行动反坦克炮整备 −18%")},
{TEXT("Reinforcing plates are riveted to the hull; gunners check the railway approaches.\nThe train withstands more damage, and railway anti-tank guns answer again sooner.\nArmoured-train hull durability +22%\nRailway anti-tank-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("Reinforcing plates are riveted to the hull; gunners check the railway approaches."), TEXT("The train withstands more damage, and railway anti-tank guns answer again sooner."), TEXT("Armoured-train hull durability +22%\nRailway anti-tank-gun readiness −18%")},
{TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n补给训练之外，再加快步兵整备。\n步兵整备 −8%"), TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。"), TEXT("补给训练之外，再加快步兵整备。"), TEXT("步兵整备 −8%")},
{TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section’s kit.\nInfantry readiness improves further after supply training.\nInfantry readiness −8%"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section’s kit."), TEXT("Infantry readiness improves further after supply training."), TEXT("Infantry readiness −8%")},
{TEXT("射手记下仰角，练习弹落在标定地段。\n枪榴弹落点更集中。\n枪榴弹散布半径 −15%"), TEXT("射手记下仰角，练习弹落在标定地段。"), TEXT("枪榴弹落点更集中。"), TEXT("枪榴弹散布半径 −15%")},
{TEXT("The gunner records the elevation as practice rounds fall on the marked ground.\nRifle grenades fall in a tighter cluster.\nRifle-grenade scatter radius −15%"), TEXT("The gunner records the elevation as practice rounds fall on the marked ground."), TEXT("Rifle grenades fall in a tighter cluster."), TEXT("Rifle-grenade scatter radius −15%")},
{TEXT("钢板上的弹痕逐发标记，射手重新稳住枪托。\n反坦克步枪更准确，命中后也更容易击穿装甲。\n反坦克步枪散布 −15%"), TEXT("钢板上的弹痕逐发标记，射手重新稳住枪托。"), TEXT("反坦克步枪更准确，命中后也更容易击穿装甲。"), TEXT("反坦克步枪散布 −15%")},
{TEXT("Strikes on the test plate are marked; the gunner braces the stock again.\nTank rifles fire more accurately and penetrate more reliably after a hit.\nTank-rifle scatter −15%"), TEXT("Strikes on the test plate are marked; the gunner braces the stock again."), TEXT("Tank rifles fire more accurately and penetrate more reliably after a hit."), TEXT("Tank-rifle scatter −15%")},
{TEXT("电话线敷进新占交通壕，前沿报回目标。\n据守中央之后的第一道敌壕，让间接火力更早抵达。\n首轮炮火提前 2 秒"), TEXT("电话线敷进新占交通壕，前沿报回目标。"), TEXT("据守中央之后的第一道敌壕，让间接火力更早抵达。"), TEXT("首轮炮火提前 2 秒")},
{TEXT("Wire enters the captured communication trench; the forward post reports its target.\nHolding the first enemy trench beyond the centre brings indirect fire sooner.\nOpening salvo 2 seconds sooner"), TEXT("Wire enters the captured communication trench; the forward post reports its target."), TEXT("Holding the first enemy trench beyond the centre brings indirect fire sooner."), TEXT("Opening salvo 2 seconds sooner")},
{TEXT("枪手把弹盘装进携行袋，枪架在路旁放下。\n一名 刘易斯 枪手与三名步枪手快速换位，停稳架枪后开火。射程和压制弱于固定枪组。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("枪手把弹盘装进携行袋，枪架在路旁放下。"), TEXT("一名 刘易斯 枪手与三名步枪手快速换位，停稳架枪后开火。射程和压制弱于固定枪组。"), TEXT("架设与收枪速度 +30%")},
{TEXT("The gunner stows his pan magazines and lowers the mounting beside the road.\nOne Lewis gunner and three riflemen move rapidly between posts, halting to deploy and fire. Their range and suppression are lower than a fixed crew’s.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("The gunner stows his pan magazines and lowers the mounting beside the road."), TEXT("One Lewis gunner and three riflemen move rapidly between posts, halting to deploy and fire. Their range and suppression are lower than a fixed crew’s."), TEXT("Deployment and packing speed +30%")},
{TEXT("携弹手背起弹带箱，枪手在浅沟放下枪架。\n一名 MG 08/15 枪手与三名步枪手快速换位，停稳架枪后开火。射程和压制弱于固定枪组。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("携弹手背起弹带箱，枪手在浅沟放下枪架。"), TEXT("一名 MG 08/15 枪手与三名步枪手快速换位，停稳架枪后开火。射程和压制弱于固定枪组。"), TEXT("架设与收枪速度 +30%")},
{TEXT("The bearer shoulders his belt boxes while the gunner lowers the mounting in a ditch.\nOne MG 08/15 gunner and three riflemen move rapidly between posts, halting to deploy and fire. Their range and suppression are lower than a fixed crew’s.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("The bearer shoulders his belt boxes while the gunner lowers the mounting in a ditch."), TEXT("One MG 08/15 gunner and three riflemen move rapidly between posts, halting to deploy and fire. Their range and suppression are lower than a fixed crew’s."), TEXT("Deployment and packing speed +30%")},
{TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。\n指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，为野炮与迫击炮校射。移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡会中断校射。\n首轮炮火提前 2.5 秒\n散布 −30%"), TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。"), TEXT("指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，为野炮与迫击炮校射。移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡会中断校射。"), TEXT("首轮炮火提前 2.5 秒\n散布 −30%")},
{TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, the command section registers guns and mortars. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion’s death interrupts registration.\nOpening salvo 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter −30%"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire."), TEXT("Halted with a companion and a clear view, the command section registers guns and mortars. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion’s death interrupts registration."), TEXT("Opening salvo 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter −30%")},
{TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。"), TEXT("解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。"), TEXT("架设与收枪速度 +30%")},
{TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march."), TEXT("Mobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation."), TEXT("Deployment and packing speed +30%")},
{TEXT("射手倒下，同伴接住枪托。\n同伴抵达枪位后接替 刘易斯 射手，继续使用剩余弹药。"), TEXT("射手倒下，同伴接住枪托。"), TEXT("同伴抵达枪位后接替 刘易斯 射手，继续使用剩余弹药。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The gunner falls; a crewman takes the stock.\nCrewmen reaching the post take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition."), TEXT("The gunner falls; a crewman takes the stock."), TEXT("Crewmen reaching the post take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("观察员守住电话，携弹手伏在旁边。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火提前 2.5 秒\n散布 −30%"), TEXT("观察员守住电话，携弹手伏在旁边。"), TEXT("指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮与迫击炮校射。"), TEXT("首轮炮火提前 2.5 秒\n散布 −30%")},
{TEXT("The observer guards the telephone, his bearer beside him.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, the command section can register guns and mortars.\nOpening salvo 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter −30%"), TEXT("The observer guards the telephone, his bearer beside him."), TEXT("Halted with a companion and a clear view, the command section can register guns and mortars."), TEXT("Opening salvo 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter −30%")},
{TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。"), TEXT("狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench."), TEXT("Snipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。"), TEXT("晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。"), TEXT("指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒")},
{TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men."), TEXT("The promoted officer rallies troops even on the move."), TEXT("Command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds")},
{TEXT("枪口退入胸墙暗影，只留一道射孔。\n驻壕机枪手更难被枪弹压住或击中。\n驻壕枪手中弹概率 −25%\n所受枪弹压制 −25%"), TEXT("枪口退入胸墙暗影，只留一道射孔。"), TEXT("驻壕机枪手更难被枪弹压住或击中。"), TEXT("驻壕枪手中弹概率 −25%\n所受枪弹压制 −25%")},
{TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet’s shadow, leaving a narrow loophole.\nEntrenched gunners are harder to hit or suppress with bullets.\nEntrenched gunner hit chance −25%\nBullet suppression taken −25%"), TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet’s shadow, leaving a narrow loophole."), TEXT("Entrenched gunners are harder to hit or suppress with bullets."), TEXT("Entrenched gunner hit chance −25%\nBullet suppression taken −25%")},
{TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。"), TEXT("整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet."), TEXT("A trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。"), TEXT("迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。"), TEXT("首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%")},
{TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot."), TEXT("Mortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration."), TEXT("Opening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%")},
{TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。"), TEXT("投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。"), TEXT("佩戴后毒气累积 −78%")},
{TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings."), TEXT("Bombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped."), TEXT("Gas build-up after masking −78%")},
{TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。\n己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹和航空轰炸更快再次接令。\n紧急火力整备 −22%"), TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。"), TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹和航空轰炸更快再次接令。"), TEXT("紧急火力整备 −22%")},
{TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened.\nBelow 35 friendly morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel and aerial bombing answer again sooner.\nEmergency-fire readiness −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened."), TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel and aerial bombing answer again sooner."), TEXT("Emergency-fire readiness −22%")},
{TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。\n按车型备齐零件，缩短装甲整备。\n缴获 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。"), TEXT("按车型备齐零件，缩短装甲整备。"), TEXT("缴获 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%")},
{TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts.\nParts sorted by pattern shorten armour readiness.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts."), TEXT("Parts sorted by pattern shorten armour readiness."), TEXT("Captured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%")},
{TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。\n备件与车组提前就位，装甲更快再次出动。\n全部装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。"), TEXT("备件与车组提前就位，装甲更快再次出动。"), TEXT("全部装甲整备 −10%")},
{TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment.\nCrews and supplies bring the vehicles back into action sooner.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment."), TEXT("Crews and supplies bring the vehicles back into action sooner."), TEXT("All armour readiness −10%")},
{TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。\n加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。\n履带耐久 +18%"), TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。"), TEXT("加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。"), TEXT("履带耐久 +18%")},
{TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks.\nReinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability.\nTrack durability +18%"), TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks."), TEXT("Reinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability."), TEXT("Track durability +18%")},
{TEXT("回收队在修理棚里试装履带节与销轴。\n加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。\n履带耐久 +25%"), TEXT("回收队在修理棚里试装履带节与销轴。"), TEXT("加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。"), TEXT("履带耐久 +25%")},
{TEXT("The recovery crew tests links and pins in the workshop.\nReinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability.\nTrack durability +25%"), TEXT("The recovery crew tests links and pins in the workshop."), TEXT("Reinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability."), TEXT("Track durability +25%")},
{TEXT("枪座补上铆接护件，车组校正机枪轴线。\n护件提高枪位承受损伤的能力。\n车载机枪耐久 +35%"), TEXT("枪座补上铆接护件，车组校正机枪轴线。"), TEXT("护件提高枪位承受损伤的能力。"), TEXT("车载机枪耐久 +35%")},
{TEXT("Riveted reinforcement braces the mounting; the crew checks the gun’s alignment.\nThe guards keep the gun mounting in action under damage.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +35%"), TEXT("Riveted reinforcement braces the mounting; the crew checks the gun’s alignment."), TEXT("The guards keep the gun mounting in action under damage."), TEXT("Vehicle machine-gun durability +35%")},
{TEXT("护板铆在射孔旁，枪手试转枪座。\n护板提高枪位承受损伤的能力。\n车载机枪耐久 +20%"), TEXT("护板铆在射孔旁，枪手试转枪座。"), TEXT("护板提高枪位承受损伤的能力。"), TEXT("车载机枪耐久 +20%")},
{TEXT("A guard is riveted beside the port as the gunner tests the mounting.\nProtected mountings withstand more damage.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +20%"), TEXT("A guard is riveted beside the port as the gunner tests the mounting."), TEXT("Protected mountings withstand more damage."), TEXT("Vehicle machine-gun durability +20%")},
{TEXT("炮手报出目标，装填手合上炮闩。\n炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。\n坦克炮装填时间 −8%"), TEXT("炮手报出目标，装填手合上炮闩。"), TEXT("炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。"), TEXT("坦克炮装填时间 −8%")},
{TEXT("The gunner calls the target; the loader closes the breech.\nThe crew shortens the loading pause between shots.\nTank cannon reload time −8%"), TEXT("The gunner calls the target; the loader closes the breech."), TEXT("The crew shortens the loading pause between shots."), TEXT("Tank cannon reload time −8%")},
{TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。"), TEXT("炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。"), TEXT("坦克炮装填时间 −12%")},
{TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner’s word.\nThe crew shortens the loading pause between shots.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner’s word."), TEXT("The crew shortens the loading pause between shots."), TEXT("Tank cannon reload time −12%")},
{TEXT("工兵随雌型战车穿过壕沿，剪钳挂在腰间。\n解锁工兵配置，两名工兵随车清障、维修。整备最快，缺少反坦克炮；工兵阵亡后作业停止。\n机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("工兵随雌型战车穿过壕沿，剪钳挂在腰间。"), TEXT("解锁工兵配置，两名工兵随车清障、维修。整备最快，缺少反坦克炮；工兵阵亡后作业停止。"), TEXT("机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%")},
{TEXT("Sappers follow the Female over the trench lip, cutters at their belts.\nThe engineer configuration brings two pioneers for clearance and repair. It has the shortest readiness and no anti-tank cannon; work stops if the pioneers are killed.\nMachine-gun burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("Sappers follow the Female over the trench lip, cutters at their belts."), TEXT("The engineer configuration brings two pioneers for clearance and repair. It has the shortest readiness and no anti-tank cannon; work stops if the pioneers are killed."), TEXT("Machine-gun burst recovery +75%")},
{TEXT("前部射孔换装双机枪，弹带箱填满车内。\n解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型 Gretchen，供 1918 年行动使用。机枪型用于压制步兵，同一时间只可出动一辆。"), TEXT("前部射孔换装双机枪，弹带箱填满车内。"), TEXT("解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型 Gretchen，供 1918 年行动使用。机枪型用于压制步兵，同一时间只可出动一辆。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Twin guns fill the front ports; belt boxes occupy the interior.\nUnlocks A7V 501 in the eight-gun Gretchen configuration for operations in 1918. Its guns suppress infantry; only one may be active."), TEXT("Twin guns fill the front ports; belt boxes occupy the interior."), TEXT("Unlocks A7V 501 in the eight-gun Gretchen configuration for operations in 1918. Its guns suppress infantry; only one may be active."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型，供 1918 年 8 月起的行动使用。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备较长。"), TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。"), TEXT("解锁 Mark V 雄型，供 1918 年 8 月起的行动使用。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备较长。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission.\nUnlocks Mark V Male for operations from August 1918. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, with longer readiness."), TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission."), TEXT("Unlocks Mark V Male for operations from August 1918. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, with longer readiness."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。"), TEXT("步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。"), TEXT("坦克机枪命中率 +10%")},
{TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth."), TEXT("Infantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners."), TEXT("Tank machine-gun accuracy +10%")},
{TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。"), TEXT("周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。"), TEXT("机枪修复后耐久 50%")},
{TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools."), TEXT("With no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle."), TEXT("Repaired machine-gun durability 50%")},
{TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口越过壕沿。\nMark V 双炮打击阵位和装甲，机动、防护强于 Mark IV。整备较长，侧翼需要步兵。"), TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口越过壕沿。"), TEXT("Mark V 双炮打击阵位和装甲，机动、防护强于 Mark IV。整备较长，侧翼需要步兵。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip.\nMark V’s twin cannon attack posts and armour. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, it has longer readiness and needs infantry on its flanks."), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip."), TEXT("Mark V’s twin cannon attack posts and armour. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, it has longer readiness and needs infantry on its flanks."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵随五机枪战车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。\n机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳剪开残丝。"), TEXT("两名皇家工兵随五机枪战车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。"), TEXT("机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%")},
{TEXT("The Female covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks beside a five-gun tank. Their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness.\nMachine-gun burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("The Female covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire."), TEXT("Two Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks beside a five-gun tank. Their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness."), TEXT("Machine-gun burst recovery +75%")},
{TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501 的八机枪配置压制步兵，无法毁伤坦克车体。同一时间只可出动一辆。"), TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。"), TEXT("A7V 501 的八机枪配置压制步兵，无法毁伤坦克车体。同一时间只可出动一辆。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501’s eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active."), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes."), TEXT("A7V 501’s eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。\n两名 德军工兵 随车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。\n机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。"), TEXT("两名 德军工兵 随车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。"), TEXT("机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%")},
{TEXT("The captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear.\nTwo Pioniere clear obstacles and repair tracks; their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness.\nMachine-gun burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("The captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear."), TEXT("Two Pioniere clear obstacles and repair tracks; their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness."), TEXT("Machine-gun burst recovery +75%")},
{TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮闩旁。\n榴霰弹炮组增加一轮齐射。\n齐射轮数 2 → 3\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮闩旁。"), TEXT("榴霰弹炮组增加一轮齐射。"), TEXT("齐射轮数 2 → 3\n每轮炮弹 3 发")},
{TEXT("Fuzes are set; reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nThe shrapnel battery adds another salvo.\nSalvos 2 → 3\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; reserve shells wait beside the breech."), TEXT("The shrapnel battery adds another salvo."), TEXT("Salvos 2 → 3\nShells per salvo 3")},
{TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n补给训练之外，再加快步兵整备。\n步兵整备 −8%"), TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。"), TEXT("补给训练之外，再加快步兵整备。"), TEXT("步兵整备 −8%")},
{TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section’s kit.\nInfantry readiness improves further after supply training.\nInfantry readiness −8%"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section’s kit."), TEXT("Infantry readiness improves further after supply training."), TEXT("Infantry readiness −8%")},
{TEXT("机修工在备件箱旁逐台试车。\n工场更快备齐出动车辆。\n全部装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("机修工在备件箱旁逐台试车。"), TEXT("工场更快备齐出动车辆。"), TEXT("全部装甲整备 −10%")},
{TEXT("Fitters test the engines beside rows of spare parts.\nThe workshops ready vehicles for another call sooner.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("Fitters test the engines beside rows of spare parts."), TEXT("The workshops ready vehicles for another call sooner."), TEXT("All armour readiness −10%")},
{TEXT("缴获车体驶回工场，备件按型号分装。\n按车型备齐零件，缩短装甲整备。\n缴获 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("缴获车体驶回工场，备件按型号分装。"), TEXT("按车型备齐零件，缩短装甲整备。"), TEXT("缴获 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%")},
{TEXT("Captured hulls return to workshops, with parts sorted by pattern.\nPrepared spares shorten armour readiness.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("Captured hulls return to workshops, with parts sorted by pattern."), TEXT("Prepared spares shorten armour readiness."), TEXT("Captured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%")},
{TEXT("回收队在断履旁卸下销轴和履带节。\n备用履带节提高行走机构的耐久。\n履带耐久 +25%"), TEXT("回收队在断履旁卸下销轴和履带节。"), TEXT("备用履带节提高行走机构的耐久。"), TEXT("履带耐久 +25%")},
{TEXT("Recovery men unload pins and links beside the broken track.\nSpare links strengthen the running gear.\nTrack durability +25%"), TEXT("Recovery men unload pins and links beside the broken track."), TEXT("Spare links strengthen the running gear."), TEXT("Track durability +25%")},
{TEXT("工兵把新销轴打入磨损的履带节。\n新销轴提高行走机构的耐久。\n履带耐久 +18%"), TEXT("工兵把新销轴打入磨损的履带节。"), TEXT("新销轴提高行走机构的耐久。"), TEXT("履带耐久 +18%")},
{TEXT("Pioneers drive fresh pins into a worn length of track.\nNew pins strengthen the running gear.\nTrack durability +18%"), TEXT("Pioneers drive fresh pins into a worn length of track."), TEXT("New pins strengthen the running gear."), TEXT("Track durability +18%")},
{TEXT("钢制护板补强狭窄的枪位。\n护板提高车载枪位承受损伤的能力。\n车载机枪耐久 +20%"), TEXT("钢制护板补强狭窄的枪位。"), TEXT("护板提高车载枪位承受损伤的能力。"), TEXT("车载机枪耐久 +20%")},
{TEXT("Steel guards brace the crowded gun positions.\nThe guards keep gun mountings in action under damage.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +20%"), TEXT("Steel guards brace the crowded gun positions."), TEXT("The guards keep gun mountings in action under damage."), TEXT("Vehicle machine-gun durability +20%")},
{TEXT("机修工在暴露的枪座旁铆上护板。\n护板提高车载枪位承受损伤的能力。\n车载机枪耐久 +35%"), TEXT("机修工在暴露的枪座旁铆上护板。"), TEXT("护板提高车载枪位承受损伤的能力。"), TEXT("车载机枪耐久 +35%")},
{TEXT("Fitters rivet a guard beside the exposed gun mounting.\nThe guards keep gun mountings in action under damage.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +35%"), TEXT("Fitters rivet a guard beside the exposed gun mounting."), TEXT("The guards keep gun mountings in action under damage."), TEXT("Vehicle machine-gun durability +35%")},
{TEXT("空弹壳落地，装填手已接过下一发炮弹。\n炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("空弹壳落地，装填手已接过下一发炮弹。"), TEXT("炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。"), TEXT("坦克炮装填时间 −12%")},
{TEXT("The loader takes the next shell as the empty case falls clear.\nThe crew shortens the loading pause between shots.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("The loader takes the next shell as the empty case falls clear."), TEXT("The crew shortens the loading pause between shots."), TEXT("Tank cannon reload time −12%")},
{TEXT("炮手贴住瞄具，装填手按口令推弹入膛。\n炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。\n坦克炮装填时间 −8%"), TEXT("炮手贴住瞄具，装填手按口令推弹入膛。"), TEXT("炮组缩短两次射击间的装填空隙。"), TEXT("坦克炮装填时间 −8%")},
{TEXT("The gunner holds the sight as the loader feeds a shell on command.\nThe crew shortens the loading pause between shots.\nTank cannon reload time −8%"), TEXT("The gunner holds the sight as the loader feeds a shell on command."), TEXT("The crew shortens the loading pause between shots."), TEXT("Tank cannon reload time −8%")},
{TEXT("工兵守在车侧，剪钳和工具随身携带。\n每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵，清障、抢修受损部件。工兵阵亡后作业停止。"), TEXT("工兵守在车侧，剪钳和工具随身携带。"), TEXT("每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵，清障、抢修受损部件。工兵阵亡后作业停止。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Sappers keep beside the hull, cutters and tools at hand.\nEach heavy tank brings two engineers for clearance and module repair. Their deaths stop the work."), TEXT("Sappers keep beside the hull, cutters and tools at hand."), TEXT("Each heavy tank brings two engineers for clearance and module repair. Their deaths stop the work."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("工兵沿履带压出的通路穿过残丝。\n每辆 A7V 或缴获 Mark IV 随车配属两名工兵，清障、抢修受损部件。工兵阵亡后作业停止。"), TEXT("工兵沿履带压出的通路穿过残丝。"), TEXT("每辆 A7V 或缴获 Mark IV 随车配属两名工兵，清障、抢修受损部件。工兵阵亡后作业停止。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Pioneers follow the tracks through the wire.\nEach A7V or captured Mark IV brings two pioneers for clearance and module repair. Their deaths stop the work."), TEXT("Pioneers follow the tracks through the wire."), TEXT("Each A7V or captured Mark IV brings two pioneers for clearance and module repair. Their deaths stop the work."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("驾驶员独自操纵车体，履带转向新阵位。\n解锁 Mark V 与 Mark V*，按行动日期配属。Mark V* 更善跨越宽壕，加长车体转向较慢。"), TEXT("驾驶员独自操纵车体，履带转向新阵位。"), TEXT("解锁 Mark V 与 Mark V*，按行动日期配属。Mark V* 更善跨越宽壕，加长车体转向较慢。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("The driver works the controls alone as the tank turns.\nUnlocks Mark V and Mark V* when their dated allocation arrives. Mark V* crosses wider trenches, but its longer hull turns slowly."), TEXT("The driver works the controls alone as the tank turns."), TEXT("Unlocks Mark V and Mark V* when their dated allocation arrives. Mark V* crosses wider trenches, but its longer hull turns slowly."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("车首双机枪占据原来的炮位。\n解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型，可在出战序列中替换火炮型 A7V。同一时间只可出动一辆 Gretchen。"), TEXT("车首双机枪占据原来的炮位。"), TEXT("解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型，可在出战序列中替换火炮型 A7V。同一时间只可出动一辆 Gretchen。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Twin front guns fill the place of the cannon.\nUnlocks A7V 501’s eight-gun configuration in place of the cannon A7V in the order of battle. Only one Gretchen may be active."), TEXT("Twin front guns fill the place of the cannon."), TEXT("Unlocks A7V 501’s eight-gun configuration in place of the cannon A7V in the order of battle. Only one Gretchen may be active."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("步兵观察车侧死角里的壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克前进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("步兵观察车侧死角里的壕口。"), TEXT("步兵贴着坦克前进，为车上的枪手指出目标。"), TEXT("坦克机枪命中率 +10%")},
{TEXT("Infantry watch the trench mouths hidden beside the hull.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Infantry watch the trench mouths hidden beside the hull."), TEXT("Infantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners."), TEXT("Tank machine-gun accuracy +10%")},
{TEXT("突击队指出侧舱下方的敌军枪位。\n步兵贴着坦克前进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("突击队指出侧舱下方的敌军枪位。"), TEXT("步兵贴着坦克前进，为车上的枪手指出目标。"), TEXT("坦克机枪命中率 +10%")},
{TEXT("The assault section points out a gun position beneath the sponson.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("The assault section points out a gun position beneath the sponson."), TEXT("Infantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners."), TEXT("Tank machine-gun accuracy +10%")},
{TEXT("工兵拆开枪座，车组递来备用枪机。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("工兵拆开枪座，车组递来备用枪机。"), TEXT("周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。"), TEXT("机枪修复后耐久 50%")},
{TEXT("A sapper opens the mounting while the crew passes a spare action.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("A sapper opens the mounting while the crew passes a spare action."), TEXT("With no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle."), TEXT("Repaired machine-gun durability 50%")},
{TEXT("受损枪机从狭窄射孔中卸下。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("受损枪机从狭窄射孔中卸下。"), TEXT("周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。"), TEXT("机枪修复后耐久 50%")},
{TEXT("The damaged action is lifted through the narrow firing port.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("The damaged action is lifted through the narrow firing port."), TEXT("With no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle."), TEXT("Repaired machine-gun durability 50%")},
{TEXT("工具和油料已运到前沿停车场。\n前沿勤务继续缩短工场整备所需时间。\n全部装甲整备再 −10%"), TEXT("工具和油料已运到前沿停车场。"), TEXT("前沿勤务继续缩短工场整备所需时间。"), TEXT("全部装甲整备再 −10%")},
{TEXT("Tools and fuel wait at the forward tank park.\nForward servicing shortens readiness further after the workshop improvement.\nAll armour readiness another −10%"), TEXT("Tools and fuel wait at the forward tank park."), TEXT("Forward servicing shortens readiness further after the workshop improvement."), TEXT("All armour readiness another −10%")},
{TEXT("修复的战车从工场灯下重新驶出。\n前沿勤务继续缩短工场整备所需时间。\n全部装甲整备再 −10%"), TEXT("修复的战车从工场灯下重新驶出。"), TEXT("前沿勤务继续缩短工场整备所需时间。"), TEXT("全部装甲整备再 −10%")},
