{TEXT("车组在出动前补强松动的铆接处。\n补强车体，提高承受炮火的能力。\n车体耐久 +18%"), TEXT("车组在出动前补强松动的铆接处。"), TEXT("补强车体，提高承受炮火的能力。"), TEXT("车体耐久 +18%")},
{TEXT("Crews renew weakened joints before leaving the park.\nHull reinforcement withstands more damage.\nHull durability +18%"), TEXT("Crews renew weakened joints before leaving the park."), TEXT("Hull reinforcement withstands more damage."), TEXT("Hull durability +18%")},
{TEXT("机修工把松动钢板重新固定在车架上。\n补强车体，提高承受炮火的能力。\n车体耐久 +22%"), TEXT("机修工把松动钢板重新固定在车架上。"), TEXT("补强车体，提高承受炮火的能力。"), TEXT("车体耐久 +22%")},
{TEXT("Fitters secure a loose plate against the heavy frame.\nHull reinforcement withstands more damage.\nHull durability +22%"), TEXT("Fitters secure a loose plate against the heavy frame."), TEXT("Hull reinforcement withstands more damage."), TEXT("Hull durability +22%")},
{TEXT("驾驶员转动传动轴，机修工校正链条。\n改善传动，让装甲更快推进。\n装甲移动速度 +12%"), TEXT("驾驶员转动传动轴，机修工校正链条。"), TEXT("改善传动，让装甲更快推进。"), TEXT("装甲移动速度 +12%")},
{TEXT("The fitter aligns the chain while the driver turns the shaft.\nImproved transmission speeds the advance.\nArmour movement speed +12%"), TEXT("The fitter aligns the chain while the driver turns the shaft."), TEXT("Improved transmission speeds the advance."), TEXT("Armour movement speed +12%")},
{TEXT("发动机启动前，车组收紧磨损的传动链。\n改善传动，让装甲更快推进。\n装甲移动速度 +10%"), TEXT("发动机启动前，车组收紧磨损的传动链。"), TEXT("改善传动，让装甲更快推进。"), TEXT("装甲移动速度 +10%")},
{TEXT("A worn drive chain is tightened before the engine starts.\nImproved transmission speeds the advance.\nArmour movement speed +10%"), TEXT("A worn drive chain is tightened before the engine starts."), TEXT("Improved transmission speeds the advance."), TEXT("Armour movement speed +10%")},
