{TEXT("五挺 刘易斯 扫过车体四周，步兵紧跟履带。\nMark IV 的机枪型，反步兵火力更强、整备更快，缺少火炮。出战前在雄型与雌型之间择一。"), TEXT("五挺 刘易斯 扫过车体四周，步兵紧跟履带。"), TEXT("Mark IV 的机枪型，反步兵火力更强、整备更快，缺少火炮。出战前在雄型与雌型之间择一。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Five Lewis guns sweep around the hull as infantry follows the tracks.\nThe machine-gun Mark IV has stronger infantry fire and shorter readiness, but no cannon. Choose Male or Female before the operation."), TEXT("Five Lewis guns sweep around the hull as infantry follows the tracks."), TEXT("The machine-gun Mark IV has stronger infantry fire and shorter readiness, but no cannon. Choose Male or Female before the operation."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("四挺 霍奇基斯 守住狭小战斗舱四周。\n快速履带坦克在开阔地扩大突破、追击暴露步兵。装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。"), TEXT("四挺 霍奇基斯 守住狭小战斗舱四周。"), TEXT("快速履带坦克在开阔地扩大突破、追击暴露步兵。装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。"), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns cover the approaches around a compact fighting compartment.\nA fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground and pursuing exposed infantry. Light protection and no cannon leave it vulnerable to armour."), TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns cover the approaches around a compact fighting compartment."), TEXT("A fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground and pursuing exposed infantry. Light protection and no cannon leave it vulnerable to armour."), TEXT("")},
