{TEXT("The 57 mm cannon faces forward; side gunners watch the tall hull’s flanks.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire, while rough ground hinders movement. Research unlocks the Gretchen machine-gun alternative."), TEXT("The 57 mm cannon faces forward; side gunners watch the tall hull’s flanks."), TEXT("One cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire, while rough ground hinders movement. Research unlocks the Gretchen machine-gun alternative."), TEXT("")},
{TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，缴获备件更有效地缩短整备。出战前可换为五机枪配置。"), TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。"), TEXT("双炮与机枪支援突击，缴获备件更有效地缩短整备。出战前可换为五机枪配置。"), TEXT("")},
